e (brutto)</td><td class="amount">22.491,00 €</td></tr></table></div><div class="page page-break"><div class="appendix-header"></div><div class="appendix-title">HOAI-Honorarübersicht</div><div class="appendix-subtitle"> K-01 – Objektplanung Gebäude &middot; A-2026-016 – Machbarkeitsstudie Verwaltungsgebäude &middot; Stand: 01.09.2026 </div><div class="section-title-h">Basisdaten</div><div class="basis-grid"><div class="basis-cell"><div class="bc-label">Honorarordnung</div><div class="bc-val">HOAI 2021 § 35</div></div><div class="basis-cell"><div class="bc-label">Honorarzone</div><div class="bc-val">III</div></div><div class="basis-cell"><div class="bc-label">Zonenanteil</div><div class="bc-val">50 %</div></div></div><table class="data-table" style="margin-top:3mm"><thead><tr><th style="width:12%">Kx</th><th class="num">Baukosten €</th><th class="num">Grundhonorar €</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>K3</td><td class="num">2.400.000,00 €</td><td class="num">228.350,00 €</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="section-title-h">Leistungsphasen</div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:38%">Leistungsphase</th><th>Kx</th><th class="num">Basis €</th><th class="num">Basis %</th><th class="num">Basis-Honorar €</th><th class="num">Honorar %</th><th class="num">Honorar €</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LP2 – Vorplanung</td><td>K3</td><td class="num">228.350,00 €</td><td class="num">7</td><td class="num">15.984,50 €</td><td class="num">7</td><td class="num">15.984,50 €</td></tr><tr><td>LP3 – Entwurfsplanung</td><td>K3</td><td class="num">228.350,00 €</td><td class="num">15</td><td class="num">34.252,50 €</td><td class="num">15</td><td class="num">34.252,50 €</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td colspan="5">Grundhonorar</td><td></td><td class="num">50.237,00 €</td></tr></tfoot></table><div class="section-title-h">Besondere Leistungen</div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:12%">Kürzel</th><th style="width:45%">Bezeichnung</th><th>LPH-Bezug</th><th class